# The build/ subdirectories are standalone, independently-versioned Flox build
# repos — each has its own .git and is pushed to its own remote so it can be
# cloned and `flox publish`-ed on its own (see README.md, "publish under your own
# Flox org namespace"). They are intentionally NOT tracked by this repo; manage
# them separately.
build/

# Flox build outputs (regenerable via `flox build`)
result-*
